sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Seller
  participant Co as Commerce
  participant K as Kafka
  participant F as Fulfillment
  participant CR as Courier
  participant P as Payment
  participant T as Trust
  S->>Co: mark seller order PACKED (before dispatch deadline)
  Co--)K: OrderPacked
  K--)F: OrderPacked
  F->>CR: book shipment
  CR-->>F: AWB + label
  F--)K: ShipmentBooked
  CR->>F: webhook picked up (signed, deduplicated)
  F--)K: OrderShipped
  CR->>F: webhooks in transit, out for delivery
  alt delivered
    CR->>F: webhook delivered
    F--)K: OrderDelivered
    K--)Co: seller order DELIVERED, return window starts
    K--)P: start return-window hold
    K--)T: review eligibility opens
  else delivery failed
    F--)K: DeliveryFailed, customer picks a new attempt
    opt too many failures
      F--)K: ReturnedToOrigin
      K--)Co: cancel seller order
      K--)P: refund customer
    end
  end
  Note over Co: Deadline missed without PACKED: Commerce cancels the seller order, OrderCancelled, Payment refunds.
